16:["$","p","1",{"className":"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed","children":"Temporary traffic control is governed by the Manual on Uniform Traffic Control Devices, which most states adopt or adapt. It defines the zones a work area is divided into, and the distances between them are calculated from the speed of approaching traffic — not estimated on site."}]
